{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05001","headline":"过蜀龙门 · 沈佺期","name":"过蜀龙门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙门非禹凿，诡怪乃天功。\n西南出巴峡，不与衆山同。\n长窦亘五里，宛转复嵌空。\n伏湍喣潜石，瀑水生轮风。\n流水无昼夜，喷薄龙门中。\n潭河势不测，藻葩垂彩虹。\n我行当季月，烟景共舂融。\n江关勤亦甚，巘崿意难穷。\n势将息机事，炼药此山东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}